@startuml authentication_flow
!theme plain
actor User
cloud Clerk
participant "clerk.py JWKS" as API
participant "get_admin_context" as ADMIN
participant "get_merchant_context" as MERCH
participant "get_clerk_user_id" as CUST
participant "DriverAuthService" as DRV
participant "merchant_api X-Api-Key" as MAPI

User -> Clerk: Sign in
Clerk --> User: JWT
User -> API: Bearer token
API -> ADMIN : admin routes
API -> MERCH : merchant routes + org headers
API -> CUST : customer/booking routes
User -> DRV: login + clerkToken
DRV --> User: Porterchain driver JWT
User -> MAPI: X-Api-Key
MAPI -> MERCH : merchant-api routes
@enduml
